@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Clone-consistency and path-feasibility advisory pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #495057
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F1F3F5
  BorderColor #495057
}

component "CodePropertyGraph\ntyped AST · CFG · DFG" as CPG #DBE4FF

package "I8 — inconsistent clones" #F8F9FA {
  component "exact Type-2/3 pair relation" as PAIRS #C3FAE8
  component "flat typed AST tapes\nand exact alignment" as TAPES #FFF3BF
  component "bounded bipartite GED\nupper-bound evidence" as GED #E5DBFF
  component "dominant rename mapping\nor aligned guard payload" as CLONE_RULE #D3F9D8
  component "InconsistentCloneBug\nconcrete paired witnesses" as CLONE_FINDING #FFE3E3
}

package "I9 — infeasible paths" #F8F9FA {
  component "shared typed guard root" as GUARD #C3FAE8
  component "SCCP\nconstant + executable edges" as SCCP #E5DBFF
  component "guard-local interval state" as INTERVALS #FFF3BF
  component "heap pushdown machine\nshort-circuit path partitions" as PDA #D3F9D8
  component "InfeasiblePathFinding\nbranch · redundancy · contradiction" as PATH_FINDING #FFE3E3
}

component "typed issues + explicit caps\nno incomplete negative claims" as ISSUES #FCC2D7
component "ordered immutable reports\npositive-only projections are advisory" as REPORT #FFE8CC

CPG --> PAIRS : clone detector
PAIRS --> TAPES : exact pair, not transitive class
CPG --> TAPES : iterative AST traversal
CPG --> GED : induced typed AST graphs
TAPES --> CLONE_RULE : aligned node pairs
GED --> CLONE_RULE : complete low-edit evidence
CLONE_RULE --> CLONE_FINDING

CPG --> GUARD : conditional CFG source
GUARD --> SCCP
CPG --> INTERVALS : exact state before source
GUARD --> PDA : typed Boolean AST
SCCP --> PATH_FINDING : dead edge / constant guard
INTERVALS --> PDA : initial variable ranges
PDA --> PATH_FINDING : empty truth alternatives

TAPES --> ISSUES : missing · cycle · node/alignment cap
GED --> ISSUES : capped surrogate
GUARD --> ISSUES : missing condition
PDA --> ISSUES : unsupported · cycle · state/step cap
CLONE_FINDING --> REPORT
PATH_FINDING --> REPORT
ISSUES --> REPORT

note bottom of CLONE_RULE
  A low edit count is only a candidate filter.
  Findings require typed identifier or guard evidence.
end note

note bottom of PDA
  For conjunction true, both operands constrain one path.
  For conjunction false, alternatives encode short-circuit flow.
  Disjunction is the Boolean dual.
end note

note bottom of REPORT
  The analyzers do not mutate the CPG.
  Empty findings prove absence only when issues are empty.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF>| normalized graph evidence |
|<#C3FAE8>| exact candidate or guard identity |
|<#FFF3BF>| retained structural or interval state |
|<#E5DBFF>| supporting graph analysis |
|<#D3F9D8>| semantic decision machine |
|<#FFE3E3>| advisory finding |
|<#FCC2D7>| incomplete-evidence qualification |
|<#FFE8CC>| public report boundary |
endlegend
@enduml
